   A problem is that when battling the wizard he often clones himself. It
then becomes a problem to discover which wizard has the amulet. The
easiest way to tell if an amulet is the real thing is to try to place
it in a bag. If it's the genuine article you'll get a message that the
amulet cannot be confined in such a way. If it's a cheap plastic
imitation it will go in with no trouble.



